"""Unselected source-specific completions for rank-eight summons and structures."""
IDS=['summon-greater-water-pet','summon-archlich-shade','faction-paragon','conjure-sky-fortress','shifting-fortress']
TIERS={
 'summon-greater-water-pet':('B','Printed HP/AC/heal/damage and minute are explicit; missing bounded profile and AoE geometry can reuse accepted scoped companion interfaces after explicit extension.'),
 'summon-archlich-shade':('C','A true spellcasting summon with drain needs a complete repertoire, funding/casting provenance, concentration and lifecycle without creating unrestricted resources.'),
 'faction-paragon':('C','The actual champion of an allied faction raises identity, consent, transport/representation, real profile and institutional authority choices.'),
 'conjure-sky-fortress':('C','A load-bearing floating platform needs finite structural geometry, access, movement, capacity, cover and safe conservation on suppression/expiry.'),
 'shifting-fortress':('C','A mobile stone building with real siege capability requires coupled structure, operator, weapon, collision, cargo and five-round clocks.'),
}
Q=[
('SS8-Q01',IDS,'All five preserve Action/120feet/V,S,F/rank8/base21RP and native class access. Water Pet, Archlich Shade and Faction Paragon print concentration minute; both fortresses print Instantaneous, while Shifting Fortress expressly lasts5rounds.',
 ['Reuse ordinary casting and source-qualified current interfaces; explicitly complete only the missing per-spell fields.','Identify a specific source contradiction before changing any settled contract.'],
 'Keep original current sources, schools, levels and access. No external monster/siege block or real-world physics shortcut supplies missing native mechanics. A spell title grants no extra building, class, creature type, body immunity or resources.'),
('SS8-W01',['summon-greater-water-pet'],'Printed HP90 and AC16 do not define size, mass, speed, senses, other stats or swimming.',
 ['NEW Medium finite Elemental body using an explicitly enumerated profile; retain90baseHP/16baseAC, actual owner-class stat provenance and shared companion command. Propose walk30/swim40,150lb and a complete stated anatomy/ability record.','Use the lower Water Pet profile with only the printed HP/AC/heal/attack changes, adding no swim or fluid-body capability.'],
 'Either needs exact concurrence; first adds new native mobility, second is narrower. Do not infer water breathing, squeezing, resistance, hands, passenger support or material water. Define actual creation-space fit and creation-round command opportunity; no free arrival Action.'),
('SS8-W02',['summon-greater-water-pet'],'Healing wave3d6 AoE OR2d10 cold blast supplies no geometry, range, target filter or accuracy.',
 ['NEW heal one shared3d6 pool to willing actual eligible allies intersecting a10foot-radius sphere centered on the pet with body-interior/LoE witnesses; blast one ranged60foot spell attack for2d10cold. Each option consumes the one owner-wide offensive/support allowance and actual command.','Choose a different fully specified finite heal shape/radius and cold attack/save model, preserving AoE healing and their alternative use.'],
 'Prefer the first as explicit source-scoped geometry. Apply actual per-recipient healing modifiers and full/zeroHP eligibility independently; no overheal pool, duplicate recipient or unlimited pulses. Resolve self-healing and mechanical living-ally extension explicitly; no generic admission follows from a name.'),
('SS8-W03',['summon-greater-water-pet'],'Lower Water Pet deliberately spends the shared offense/support allowance on healing and has a specific NullDisabled/healing/suppression interface.',
 ['Explicitly extend those narrow command/Null/healing permissions to this new pet, with one greater pet per caster and unchanged source minute, real maximumHP modifiers, damage ownership and cargo conservation.','Give a distinct healing/ending rule with exact reasons; do not silently create a second round allowance.'],
 'Prefer explicit extension. Pet owns its heal/attack; owner class hooks do not automatically fire. Suppression retains body/HP/deadline but cannot replay missed commands or heals. Ordinary0 ends the finite body; qualifying Null0 stays the same disabled body only under the approved extension.'),
('SS8-S01',['summon-archlich-shade'],'HP160, casts necrotic spells and drains enemies supplies no full body/profile or acquisition of a real lich.',
 ['NEW one bounded Medium shade with fully specified AC, ability scores, mass, speeds, senses and exact source-owner statistics;160baseHP and the actual concentration minute.','Use an actual complete documented existing creature profile if it preserves the source promises, with every difference explicitly reconciled.'],
 'Prefer a finite newly authored summon profile; no phylactery, actual dead person, soul ownership, elite asset identity, immunity, hover or CR follows from Archlich. Explicitly state appearance versus physical body interactions and required body organs/outlets.'),
('SS8-S02',['summon-archlich-shade'],'Casts necrotic spells requires real spell activations, not a renamed generic2d8 attack; no repertoire or RP pool is given.',
 ['NEW grant a finite named repertoire drawn from actual reviewed necrotic spells, with the owner funding each real spell cost and one actual command/offense opportunity; define actor/source, component legality, payment, countering and cadence explicitly.','Give the shade a finite creation-snapshot spell budget/charges, supply every selected spell and recharge endpoint, and demonstrate that recasting pays the actual summon cost rather than resetting free world resources.'],
 'The choice is consequential. Proposed repertoire candidates Chill Touch, Vampiric Touch and Enervation must retain their actual full procedures and dependencies; other picks need exact source support. Decide cost modification, metamagic/acquisition, Dissonance/Refrain ownership and damage/kill hooks rather than granting the owner every repertoire spell.'),
('SS8-S03',['summon-archlich-shade'],'A parent concentration spell and possible child concentration spells need separate owners and precise action scheduling.',
 ['Shade may own at most one independently paid child concentration source; owner retains parent concentration. Every cast uses an actual attached command/offense opportunity, with no separate free turn or mirrored owner action. Ending the shade ends its child concentration.','Limit the selected repertoire to nonconcentration spells and separately specify a native drain Action; retain multiple true necrotic spells.'],
 'Prefer the first only with explicit engine ownership and legal component bodies. Starting a child spell cannot accidentally terminate the owner parent or create a second owner concentration. Define channeled follow-up Actions, reaction availability, counterspells, suppression and no orphaned recurring payload.'),
('SS8-S04',['summon-archlich-shade'],'Drains enemies does not state quantity or whether HP, maximumHP or RP is gained.',
 ['NEW one native melee5foot necrotic drain attack with an exact damage pool, healing the shade for floor(actual normalHP loss/2), capped by its actual healing limits; no owner healing, maxHP theft or RP.','Attach a bounded drain rider to qualifying shade spells, specifying which target/event supplies recovery and a once-per-round cap to avoid multiplying an AoE.'],
 'Require exact damage and victim predicate. Use actual positive normalHP loss after all defenses/tempHP, not nominal damage, overkill or a friendly fabricated battery. Explain enemy selection without assigning new faction truth; ordinary healing prohibition and no copy/resource recursion remain actual. No class Life Drain package is imported.'),
('SS8-F01',['faction-paragon'],'Summon THE CHAMPION OF YOUR ALLIED FACTION may indicate a real identity; lower Faction Champion expressly creates a bounded representative.',
 ['NEW use a temporary representative of the actual faction champion with a complete finite profile and no borrowed private identity, inventory, authority or secret knowledge.','Transport the actual willing documented champion, requiring its real availability/consent/profile and a specified legal local/planar route without duplication.'],
 'Do not silently inherit the lower spell interpretation. Prefer the representative only if GPT expressly agrees it preserves this rank8 source; otherwise retain real-person content/transport holds. Neither option creates a faction, named champion or cosmology.'),
('SS8-F02',['faction-paragon'],'Allied faction and champion selection need actual institutional predicates rather than alignment or positive standing alone.',
 ['Explicitly extend actual AC5 alliedStatus+standing>0+invocationPermission+no-aid-prohibition gate; use one known factionId and declared eligible champion/profile before payment.','Supply a different exact rank8 faction entitlement with evidence and preserve hidden availability/consent checks.'],
 'Prefer scoped reuse of the actual institutional gate. Standing alone, membership or class allegiance is insufficient. State whether a later aid prohibition affects an established manifestation; no automatic official title, negotiation power, reputation gain or remote faction information.'),
('SS8-F03',['faction-paragon'],'No paragon HP/AC/actions or returned-person consequences are printed.',
 ['For a representative, author one complete source-native rank8 profile, its finite actions and shared companion limits, real concentration minute and narrow Null/healing/suppression bindings.','For the actual-person branch, retain its actual HP/resources/gear/agency/initiative and exactly one body; decide voluntary commanded assistance, arrival/return and every persistent injury/death consequence.'],
 'Complete the chosen branch in full. Do not copy an unknown NPC sheet or give it both its own full turn and an attached companion turn. Created intrinsic gear is not loot; real borrowed gear remains real. Missing exact champion/profile content keeps relevant cases held.'),
('SS8-K01',['conjure-sky-fortress'],'Printed benefit is a floating PLATFORM for high ground or ranged cover, not a whole weaponized settlement; dimensions, elevation, access and lifetime are absent.',
 ['NEW one finite horizontal platform with explicit solid geometry, rail/cover form, anchor/elevation within120feet, finite capacity and60second concentration lifetime.','Choose a different explicit size/lifetime and nonconcentration form while supplying complete support, destruction and removal rules.'],
 'Prefer a fully specified bounded platform; GPT must select exact dimensions, capacity,HP/AC/material response and safe access. Casting range is not automatic permissible elevation through obstructions. Initial solid volume must fit actual space without spawning through bodies or lifting them for free.'),
('SS8-K02',['conjure-sky-fortress'],'High ground or ranged cover must have a native mechanical meaning, while existing cover is actual line geometry with best+2/+5 only.',
 ['Platform provides actual elevation and explicit half-cover parapets; use actual lines, facing and core cover. Any additional high-ground attack benefit must be separately authored.','Choose mutually exclusive deployment forms: open raised platform or fixed ranged-cover canopy, each with explicit geometry and any source-local bonus.'],
 'Prefer real elevation/cover rather than automatic advantage or total protection. Preserve the printed useful high-ground option without inventing a universal height-to-hit rule. State ally/enemy access, attack origin and body/cover intersections.'),
('SS8-K03',['conjure-sky-fortress'],'Floating does not print travel speed or piloting; occupants/cargo cannot be erased when the source ends.',
 ['Keep the platform spatially fixed after establishment; active magic supplies support only. On suppression/destruction/expiry the structure ends or loses support according to an explicit chosen source profile; real occupants/cargo use actual Falling at their current locations.','Permit bounded commanded travel with explicit speed, operator cost, collision, load and arrival geometry as NEW additional function.'],
 'Prefer fixed support unless travel is expressly chosen. State overload and resumption without gratuitous crushing, free descent, teleportation, recreated cargo or salvage. The selected disappearance-versus-suppressed-body behavior must be consistent throughout the full casebook.'),
('SS8-T01',['shifting-fortress'],'Mobile stone BUILDING WITH SIEGE WEAPONS lasts5ROUNDS; dimensions, armor, structuralHP, rooms, load and weapon count are missing.',
 ['NEW one complete finite building chassis with explicit occupied solid/interior volumes, entrances, capacity, AC/HP and two fixed siege emplacements; keep source5round lifetime with no extra concentration unless explicitly chosen.','Select another full finite chassis/weapon count and concentration policy, preserving both useful mobility and siege capability.'],
 'GPT must author the actual numeric profile and body/material permissions. Do not turn this into a decorative platform or import an external castle/ballista block. Five rounds should bind the existing source-future-START convention or an expressly reconciled real-time clock, not silently become a minute.'),
('SS8-T02',['shifting-fortress'],'Building mobility lacks a controller, action cost, route restrictions or collision authority.',
 ['NEW one authorized operator spends an actual Action to move it up to a fixed walking Speed along a fully legal swept volume, at most once per original owner regular opportunity; it supports real occupants/cargo.','Use the creator Bonus Action to order one attached structural movement, explicitly deciding whether it shares any companion command ledger.'],
 'Choose one actual budget. The structure has no independent creature turn, free Dash, teleport, flight, forced overlap or automatic ram damage. Supply slope/step/support constraints and distinguish moving the platform beneath occupants from granting each occupant extra voluntary movement.'),
('SS8-T03',['shifting-fortress'],'Siege weapons need complete native damage/range/accuracy, loading/firing, operators and ammunition histories.',
 ['NEW finite manifest siege projectiles inseparable from this source, one explicit load/aim/fire sequence per actual emplacement and real operator Actions; projectiles vanish on resolution/expiry and create no harvest stock.','Require real compatible external ammunition and actual documented weapon profiles, with each loading/firing Action and remaining item preserved.'],
 'Select one complete weapon menu with exact ranges, damage types, attack/save formula, target predicates, LoE and structural damage permissions. Multiple weapons need multiple real operator budgets; no automatic simultaneous volley or cloned ammunition. Intrinsic ammunition may not become transferable inventory.'),
('SS8-T04',['shifting-fortress'],'Five-round expiry, structural0, suppression and occupants at elevation need one coherent ending process.',
 ['Use source-owned five future regular STARTs, excluding the casting START; source removal does not reschedule them and outside initiative use30elapsedseconds. Ending releases real occupants and external cargo at their actual positions to ordinary support/Falling; no teleport or invented crushing.','Choose an explicit absolute30second field lifetime if required by the current clock contract, preserving the printed5round intent and explaining the difference.'],
 'Prefer existing buff-clock binding where applicable. State partial structural damage, destroyed supports/weapon bays, collision failures, overload and suppressed-object persistence. Same-caster recast cannot heal damaged external cargo, replenish real ammunition or duplicate occupants; a new paid structure must still pass actual placement.'),
('SS8-X01',IDS,'Creature and structure origin, caster/controller and damage/healing ownership differ; current accepted analogues are tightly scoped.',
 ['Explicitly route each new creature native Action/spell, structural weapon and stored source through its actual creating actor and Null lifecycle. Reuse exact source-qualified recipient permissions only by named extension.','Identify a concrete contradictory source before extending an existing root/cap/suppression contract globally.'],
 'One spell-created body is not automatically the caster for every damage/kill/heal hook. Structural weapons must identify actual operator/dealer; no automatic pet Null status or creature healing on an object. Never convert structure destruction into XP, corpse, resource or material income without a real source.'),
('SS8-X02',IDS,'No complete prior procedures/cases exist for these five. Named missing profiles and operator/body geometry must remain explicit dependencies.',
 ['After choices author at least two complete deterministic cases per spell plus branches for every new consequential decision, with actual provider/repertoire/RP, geometry, clocks, commands/operators and final conserved state.','Keep unsupported champion/rating/profile/structural geometry cases held, without inventing the missing fact or reporting conditional arithmetic as runtime execution.'],
 'Use both as needed. Include Water heal/attack alternatives and caps, Shade paid child casting/drain/parent ending, faction hidden gates and actual identity policy, platform access/cover/fall, fortress mixed operator budgets/swept collision/five-round expiry and complete real-cargo conservation.'),
]
